### Feature: Vòng đời appointment (Phase 10) — confirm/complete/no-show + quyền RECEPTIONIST
### Mục tiêu: PENDING -> CONFIRMED -> COMPLETED qua confirm/complete. PENDING -> NO_SHOW trực tiếp qua no-show.
### RECEPTIONIST quản lý được appointment (xem list + confirm/complete/no-show) như ADMIN, PATIENT thì không.
### Chạy tuần tự từ trên xuống — mỗi request phụ thuộc kết quả (id/token) của request trước.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### ========================================
### 0a. Đăng ký + đăng nhập PATIENT
### ========================================
# @name registerPatient
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lifecycle-patient@example.com",
  "password": "secret123",
  "fullName": "Patient Lifecycle",
  "phone": "0900000020"
}

###

# @name loginPatient
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lifecycle-patient@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

###

@patientToken = {{loginPatient.response.body.$.data.token}}

### ========================================
### 0b. Đăng nhập ADMIN (seed sẵn)
### ========================================
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@vibecode.local",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.data.token}}

### ========================================
### 0c. ADMIN tạo tài khoản RECEPTIONIST + đăng nhập
### ========================================
# @name registerReceptionist
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register-staff
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lifecycle-receptionist@example.com",
  "password": "secret123",
  "fullName": "Receptionist Lifecycle",
  "phone": "0900000030",
  "role": "RECEPTIONIST"
}

###

# @name loginReceptionist
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lifecycle-receptionist@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

###

@receptionistToken = {{loginReceptionist.response.body.$.data.token}}

### ========================================
### 1. PATIENT đặt lịch hẹn #1 (dùng để test confirm -> complete)
### ========================================
# @name book1
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dentistId": 1,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "appointmentDate": "2026-08-10",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "notes": "Test lifecycle #1"
}

###

@appt1Id = {{book1.response.body.$.data.id}}

### ========================================
### 2. PATIENT (không phải ADMIN/RECEPTIONIST/dentist được giao) confirm lịch của chính mình → expect 403
### ========================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appt1Id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ========================================
### 3. RECEPTIONIST confirm lịch #1 (PENDING -> CONFIRMED) → expect 200
### ========================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appt1Id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionistToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ========================================
### 4. RECEPTIONIST confirm lại lịch đã CONFIRMED → expect 400 (chỉ confirm được từ PENDING)
### ========================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appt1Id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionistToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ========================================
### 5. ADMIN complete lịch #1 (CONFIRMED -> COMPLETED) → expect 200
### ========================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appt1Id}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ========================================
### 6. RECEPTIONIST đánh dấu no-show cho lịch đã COMPLETED → expect 400
### ========================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appt1Id}}/no-show
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionistToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ========================================
### 7. PATIENT đặt lịch hẹn #2 (dùng để test no-show trực tiếp từ PENDING)
### ========================================
# @name book2
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dentistId": 1,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "appointmentDate": "2026-08-10",
  "startTime": "10:00",
  "notes": "Test lifecycle #2"
}

###

@appt2Id = {{book2.response.body.$.data.id}}

### ========================================
### 8. RECEPTIONIST đánh dấu no-show trực tiếp từ PENDING (PENDING -> NO_SHOW) → expect 200
### ========================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{appt2Id}}/no-show
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionistToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ========================================
### 9. RECEPTIONIST xem danh sách appointment (như ADMIN) → expect 200
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{receptionistToken}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ========================================
### 10. PATIENT xem danh sách appointment → expect 403 (không phải ADMIN/RECEPTIONIST)
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
Accept: application/json

###
